 <div class="page active"> <section class="section"> <div class="section-header"><h2>About Gift of the Givers</h2></div> <div class="about-content"> <p>The Gift of the Givers Foundation stands as a beacon of hope in times of crisis, dedicated to providing swift and effective aid to communities struck by natural disasters and emergencies in South Africa and beyond.</p> <p>Established in response to the growing need for organised relief efforts, the foundation operates on the principles of compassion, efficiency, and resilience.</p> <h3>Our Mission</h3> <p>To enhance the effectiveness and reach of relief operations through technology, ultimately saving more lives and rebuilding communities with greater efficiency.</p> <h3>Technology Stack</h3> <p>ASP.NET Core MVC, Azure App Services, Azure Functions (HTTP Trigger for tax certificate generation), Azure SQL Database, Azure Repos Git with CI/CD Pipelines, and custom NuGet helper packages via Azure Artifacts.</p> </div> </section> </div>
